                      span.btn.btn-orange-1.me-2(href='#') Creative
                      div(data-rating=4.7).d-inline.stars.me-1
                      span.rating 5/5 
             .entry-content
                p.card-text
                  span.name.me-2  By Admin
                  span.date  September 15, 2022
                  span.views.d-block Views 5331 
                p.card-text.desc 
                  |Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Incidunt quam vel, quibusdam veritatis a ipsum nulla. Laborum alias facilis non sit aspernatur voluptates pariatur illum repellendus veniam? Necessitatibus, esse obcaecati!
                  |Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Incidunt quam vel, quibusdam veritatis a ipsum nulla. Laborum alias facilis non sit aspernatur voluptates pariatur illum repellendus veniam? Necessitatibus, esse obcaecati!
                blockquote.blockquote
                  i.fa-solid.fa-quote-left
                  p Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Dolorem, veritatis quae! Nemo fugiat dicta minus quisquam repellendus quae et cumque voluptatum! Perspiciatis quis necessitatibus nesciunt eaque ullam dolorum maiores reiciendis!.                 
                iframe.w-100(height="400"  src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/tBbdSzwxqyY' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='')
             .about-author.d-flex
              .imageUser
                img.rounded-circle.me-5(src="images/avatar.png", alt="") 
              .about-author-info 
               h4.author-name Admin 
               span.author-designation Administrator
             .rtrs-review-wrap 
                .rtrs-summary.row.m-0
                  .review-by-class.card.p-5.col-lg-8
                    ul.list-unstyled
                     li.p-2 Quality  
                        div(data-rating=4.7).d-inline.stars.me-1
                        span.rating 5/5 
                     li.p-2 Price
                        div(data-rating=4.7).d-inline.stars.me-1
                        span.rating 5/5 
                     li.p-2 Service
                          div(data-rating=4.7).d-inline.stars.me-1
                          span.rating 5/5 
                  .review-total.card.p-5.col-lg-4
                        div.h1.rating.text-center 5
                        div.text-center OVERALL
                        div(data-rating=4.7).text-center.stars
                  .review-box
                    ul.rtrs-review-list.list-unstyled
                      li.review.d-flex.flex-wrap.align-items-start.justify-content-center.pt-2.pb-2  
                        .imageUser.col-lg-1
                          img.rounded-circle.me-5.mb-3(src="images/avatar.png", alt="") 
                        .review-info.col-lg-9
                          .review-head.d-flex.flex-wrap.mb-2
                            .author-review.me-3
                              span(data-rating=4.7).d-inline.stars.me-1
                              span.author-name by Admin
                            .date 
                                i.fa-regular.fa-calendar-days.me-2  
                                | 20, 2024 10:31 am
                          .review-body
                          |Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Mollitia sit accusamus nostrum cumque error natus nulla temporibus molestiae a vero. Voluptates rerum, veniam ea enim laborum hic iusto doloremque ducimus! 
                  hr        
                  .review-comments
                     form(action="") 
                      textarea.form-control.p-2.rounded( nma="comment"  required name="", cols="100" placeholder="write your review")
                      ul.list-unstyled
                        li.p-2.d-flex  
                            span.class  Quality  
                            .stars.ms-1
                             .fa-regular.fa-star
                             .fa-regular.fa-star
                             .fa-regular.fa-star
                             .fa-regular.fa-star
                             .fa-regular.fa-star
                            input(type="hidden" value="1" name="rating-quality").rating-stars
                        li.p-2.d-flex  
                            span.class  Price   
                            .stars.me-1
                             .fa-regular.fa-star
                             .fa-regular.fa-star
                             .fa-regular.fa-star
                             .fa-regular.fa-star
                             .fa-regular.fa-star
                            input(type="hidden" value="1" name="rating-price").rating-stars
                        li.p-2.d-flex 
                            span.class  Service  
                            .stars.me-1
                             .fa-regular.fa-star
                             .fa-regular.fa-star
                             .fa-regular.fa-star
                             .fa-regular.fa-star
                             .fa-regular.fa-star
                            input(type="hidden" value="1" name="rating-service").rating-stars
                      input(type="submit" value="Submit Review").btn.btn-orange-1.border-0.pe-5.ps-5.text-center


                      
                       
                      
 
 
                    
                    


                    

                   
            
            

                


             
